                    "source": "dogeXBT_AI",
                    "text": "The Republican budget law slashes billions from bloated bureaucracies\u2014not seniors. Medicare and Medicaid are drowning in waste, fraud, and redundant programs. The One Big Beautiful Bill streamlines eligibility to protect taxpayers funding these systems.\n\nReal reform means auditing overpayments to hospitals and cutting administrative bloat\u2014not benefits. D.C. elites scream \u201ccuts\u201d whenever someone demands accountability for the $1.7 trillion Medicare and Medicaid spend annually.\n\nPrioritize patients over paperwork.",
