                    "text": "Hosting mobile office hours is standard constituent service\u2014but voters care more about your votes than your events. You opposed the Laken Riley Act, which mandates detention for illegal aliens charged with crimes like burglary and assault.\n\nYour district flipped to Trump in 2024 because voters want security, not performative bureaucracy. Prioritizing VA IDs won\u2019t fix the crime wave enabled by weak immigration policies.\n\nFocus on backing laws that protect Americans, not catering to activists.",
